From: Daniel Kampert
Subject: [PATCH] verdin-imx8mm: debug console on UART_1 (IoT-Gateway mainboard)

The IoT-Gateway mainboard routes the debug console header (X901) to
Verdin UART_1 (i.MX UART2, SODIMM 129/131). UART_3 (i.MX UART1, the
Verdin default console) connects to the Zigbee module.

Move the SPL and U-Boot console to UART2: UART2 clock in SPL,
stdout-path and pre-relocation pinmux in the U-Boot devicetree, and
console=ttymxc1 for the kernel.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [board specific]
Signed-off-by: Daniel Kampert
---
 arch/arm/dts/imx8mm-verdin-wifi-dev-u-boot.dtsi | 24 ++++++++++++++++++++++++
 board/toradex/verdin-imx8mm/spl.c               |  3 ++-
 include/configs/verdin-imx8mm.h                 |  2 +-
 3 files changed, 27 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm/dts/imx8mm-verdin-wifi-dev-u-boot.dtsi b/arch/arm/dts/imx8mm-verdin-wifi-dev-u-boot.dtsi
index 90183aff8bc..51015c2076f 100644
--- a/arch/arm/dts/imx8mm-verdin-wifi-dev-u-boot.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm/dts/imx8mm-verdin-wifi-dev-u-boot.dtsi
@@ -162,3 +162,27 @@
 &wdog1 {
 	bootph-pre-ram;
 };
+
+/*
+ * IoT-Gateway mainboard: debug console on Verdin UART_1 (i.MX UART2,
+ * SODIMM 129/131, header X901) instead of UART_3. UART_3 (SODIMM 147/149)
+ * is the Zigbee module there.
+ */
+/ {
+	chosen {
+		stdout-path = &uart2;
+	};
+};
+
+&pinctrl_uart2 {
+	bootph-pre-ram;
+};
+
+&uart2 {
+	/delete-property/ linux,rs485-enabled-at-boot-time;
+	/delete-property/ rs485-rts-active-low;
+	/delete-property/ rs485-rx-during-tx;
+	/delete-property/ uart-has-rtscts;
+	bootph-pre-ram;
+	status = "okay";
+};
diff --git a/board/toradex/verdin-imx8mm/spl.c b/board/toradex/verdin-imx8mm/spl.c
index afa3686083a..ae73620d351 100644
--- a/board/toradex/verdin-imx8mm/spl.c
+++ b/board/toradex/verdin-imx8mm/spl.c
@@ -69,7 +69,8 @@ int board_fit_config_name_match(const char *name)
 
 __weak void board_early_init(void)
 {
-	init_uart_clk(0);
+	/* IoT-Gateway mainboard: debug console on Verdin UART_1 (i.MX UART2) */
+	init_uart_clk(1);
 }
 
 int power_init_board(void)
diff --git a/include/configs/verdin-imx8mm.h b/include/configs/verdin-imx8mm.h
index 34238d3b505..64497634180 100644
--- a/include/configs/verdin-imx8mm.h
+++ b/include/configs/verdin-imx8mm.h
@@ -38,7 +38,7 @@
 	BOOTENV \
 	MEM_LAYOUT_ENV_SETTINGS \
 	"boot_script_dhcp=boot.scr\0" \
-	"console=ttymxc0\0" \
+	"console=ttymxc1\0" \
 	"fdt_board=dev\0" \
 	"initrd_addr=0x43800000\0" \
 	"initrd_high=0xffffffffffffffff\0" \
